          "description": "Astro has a pretty cool new feature that blends the best of static pre-rendering and dynamic server rendering. Matthew Phillips returns to show off Server Islands and explain how they work.\n\n[0:00] Preamble\n[8:15] Welcome Matthew Phillips & Component Architecture\n[18:30] Compilers & The Perception of Complexity\n[29:00] Suspense, Reactivity, and Framework Ecosystems\n[36:30] Server Islands: Introduction & Demo\n[41:30] SI: App vs. Site or Static vs. Dynamic\n[53:30] SI: Clarifying How It Works & Limitations\n[58:30] SI: Excalidraw! - Server Islands in Astro \n[1:04:30] SI: Excalidraw! - PPR in Next\n[1:10:00] SI: Excalidraw! - Out of Order Streaming\n[1:16:00] SI: Inspiration & Background\n[1:23:15] SI: HTTP Considerations\n[1:28:15] SI: The Spectrum of Solutions\n[1:32:15] SI: Live Performance Demos are Impossible\n[1:38:00] SI: Inspecting Network Timelines\n[1:49:45] SI: PageSpeed Insights\n[1:57:45] SI: The New JAMStack (Does PPR Matter?)\n[2:05:15] SI: Q&A - Signals in Astro? Speculation Rules? \n[2:11:30] SI: Q&A -  Streaming JSON? PPR in Astro?\n[2:14:30] SI: Conclusion & Matthew's Parting Words\n[2:19:30] Intermission: A Unified Story\n[2:31:45] Intermission: How The Giants Fall\n[2:41:30] Intermission: There's Something Here\n[2:47:30] Solid HackerNews - /hydrate Script Experiment\n[3:09:00] Run Once Suspense (Version 2)\n[3:20:45] Derivations as First Principles: Introduction\n[3:24:45] DaFP: createMemo & createProjection \n[3:28:00] DaFP: Writable Variants\n[3:32:00] DaFP: Diffing Revisited \n[3:37:00] DaFP: Trello Example\n[3:47:15] DaFP: Why Derive? & Colorless Async\n[3:55:30] DaFP: Deriving Signals from props\n[4:01:30] DaFP: Conclusion\n[4:09:15] This Week in JavaScript: Astro & Remix\n[4:11:45] TWiJ: Stack Overflow Survey\n[4:17:15] TWiJ: Atila Fassina's Content \n[4:19:45] TWiJ: Astro & Netlify\n\nThanks @zombiefacesupreme for the timestamps!!\n[4:22:00] Conclusion & Small Gift",
